- A site search's keyword then Tab: the bar becomes a pill, Return searches
  that site. Arc's way works too: "kiwi pear" with kiwi a site's keyword
  searches kiwi (it went to the default search before).
- claude / codex / ask / ai / page / summarize then Tab: Return asks that AI
  in Ask (page and summarize with the page; Summarize with nothing typed
  sums the page up). Backspace in an empty field leaves the mode.

